---
import ScrambleHeading from "../../ui/scramble-heading.astro";
---

<section id="log" class="content-section log">
    <ScrambleHeading text="Log" class="heading-2" />
    <p class="paragprah">Articles, Talks, notes, and ideas</p>
    <div>ALL, Writing, Talks</div>
    <div></div>
    <ul>
        <li>2026.06.18 WRITING AstroでMarkdownを書き、届けるまで</li>
        <li>
            2026.05.10 TALK コードの向こう側 × 校正ツール × チーム Frontend
            Conference Tokyo
        </li>
        <li>2026.04.28 WRITING Information Designとアクセシビリティ</li>
    </ul>
</section>
<style>
    .content-section {
        --section-gap: 3rem;
        --section-padding: 3rem;

        box-sizing: border-box;
        display: grid;
        gap: var(--section-gap);
        min-block-size: 100%;
        padding: var(--section-padding);
        border-block-end: 1px solid var(--color-ink);
    }

    .heading-3 {
        text-transform: uppercase;
        font-size: var(--font-size-72);
    }

    .paragprah {
        font-size: var(--font-size-16);
    }
</style>
